 class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7f98270 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7f98270\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Teflon &amp; Yapışkanlı Teflon Contalar – Yüksek Performanslı Sızdırmazlık Elemanları</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-be8b883 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"be8b883\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-947d204 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"947d204\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6662c86 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6662c86\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Teflon contalar (PTFE contalar)</strong> ve <strong>yapışkanlı Teflon contalar</strong>, endüstriyel boru hatları, vana bağlantıları, pompa gövdeleri ve çeşitli mekanik montaj noktalarında <strong>yüksek kimyasal dayanım, düşük sürtünme ve mükemmel sızdırmazlık</strong> sağlamak için kullanılan yüksek performanslı sızdırmazlık elemanlarıdır.</p><p>PTFE malzeme kimyasallara, yüksek sıcaklığa ve aşındırıcı ortamlara karşı dayanıklı olduğundan, bu contalar özellikle <strong>agresif akışkanların bulunduğu uygulamalarda</strong> tercih edilir. Yapışkanlı Teflon contalar ise uygulama sırasında <strong>kolay konumlandırma</strong> ve <strong>hızlı montaj avantajı</strong> sunar.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4209556 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"4209556\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"232\" src=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/P.T.F12.E-SERITL12ER-C12ONTALON-300x232.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-2637\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/P.T.F12.E-SERITL12ER-C12ONTALON-300x232.jpg 300w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/P.T.F12.E-SERITL12ER-C12ONTALON-768x593.jpg 768w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/P.T.F12.E-SERITL12ER-C12ONTALON.jpg 858w\" sizes=\"100vw\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-84c7c79 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"84c7c79\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fec7106 elementor-view-stacked elementor-position-inline-start elementor-tablet-position-inline-end elementor-shape-circle elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"fec7106\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-table\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M464 32H48C21.49 32 0 53.49 0 80v352c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h416c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V80c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48zM224 416H64v-96h160v96zm0-160H64v-96h160v96zm224 160H288v-96h160v96zm0-160H288v-96h160v96z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTeflon &amp; Yapışkanlı Teflon Conta – Teknik Değerler\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6659c95 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6659c95\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"514\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"185\">Özellik</td><td width=\"329\">Değer</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Ürün Tipi</td><td width=\"329\">Teflon (PTFE) Conta / Yapışkanlı PTFE Conta</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Malzeme</td><td width=\"329\">%100 PTFE (Teflon)</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Kullanım Alanı</td><td width=\"329\">Flanş, boru, vana, pompa ve kapak bağlantıları</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Sıcaklık Aralığı</td><td width=\"329\">-200°C – +260°C</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Kimyasal Direnç</td><td width=\"329\">Asit, baz, solvent, yağ, su</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Kalınlık</td><td width=\"329\">0.5 – 3 mm</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Çap Aralığı</td><td width=\"329\">10 – 600 mm</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Yapışkan Tipi (Yapışkanlı)</td><td width=\"329\">Yüksek performanslı endüstriyel yapıştırıcı</td></tr></tbody></table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d5c7818 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d5c7818\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-10cfbd4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"10cfbd4\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bc14410 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"bc14410\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-66b4cd9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"66b4cd9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Ürün Özellikleri</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a8643a0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a8643a0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>✔ <strong>Yüksek kimyasal dayanım:</strong> Asit, baz ve agresif akışkanlara dayanıklıdır<br />✔ <strong>Geniş sıcaklık toleransı:</strong> -200°C’den +260°C’ye kadar güvenli kullanım<br />✔ <strong>Düşük sürtünme:</strong> Montaj ve kullanım sırasında minimize edilir<br />✔ <strong>Kolay montaj (yapışkanlı):</strong> Kendinden yapışkanlı yüzey ile pratik uygulama<br />✔ <strong>Uzun ömür:</strong> Yüksek performans ve dayanımlı PTFE malzeme</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5e6a164 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5e6a164\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-83513a5 elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-accordion\" data-id=\"83513a5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n        <div class=\"elemen